      "source": "Creates a new <a href=\"MongoPersistentEntityIndexCreator.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.index\"><code>MongoPersistentEntityIndexCreator</code></a> for the given <a href=\"../mapping/MongoMappingContext.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.mapping\"><code>MongoMappingContext</code></a> and\n<a href=\"../../MongoDatabaseFactory.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb\"><code>MongoDatabaseFactory</code></a>.",
